# Top-level folders are anchored with a leading "/": an unanchored "app/" also matched web/app/ (the
# Next.js pages), which deployed a site with no pages. Never upload secrets or local state to Vercel (the site builds from web/ and ../sdk only).
.env*
!.env.example
**/*.keypair.json
**/id.json
**/.local/
**/node_modules/
/target/
/.anchor/
/.playwright-browsers/
**/.next/
**/test-results/
/tests/
/app/
/services/
/evidence/symmetry-fork/out/
**/*.png
!web/public/**
!web/app/*.png
